[WEASEL]
Star in low budget horror movies. Seriously, you look like Freddy Krueger face-fucked a topographical map of Utah.
ດາວໃນຮູບເງົາຄວາມຢ້ານກົວທີ່ມີງົບປະມານຕໍ່າ. ຢ່າງຈິງໃຈ,
